      "text": "[6:34PM] #LekkiPeninsula #TrafficUpdate \n\nBusy traffic at VFS to Ikate Gate, Road 14 to Lekki Ikoyi Link Bridge, and Lekki Ikoyi Link Bridge to Alenxander Avenue. \nTraffic is moving well on Dome to Zenith, Zenith to Tantalizer, and outward journeys. \nSlightly slow traffic is expected from Lekki Ikoyi Link Bridge to Scheme 1 gate due to traffic lights delay.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
